(2 epochs)\npython run_model.py --task traffic_state_pred --model LSTGAN --dataset METR_LA --max_epoch 2\n\n# Run automated tests\n./scripts/test_new_models.sh\n```\n\n### Config Generation\n```bash\n# Generate dataset-specific config\npython scripts/model_config_generator.py --model LSTGAN --dataset PEMS_BAY\n\n# Generate with custom params\npython scripts/model_config_generator.py --model MLCAFormer \\\n    --params \'{"d_model": 128, "num_heads": 16}\' \\\n    --dataset METR_LA --generate-script\n```\n\n---\n\n## Model Parameters\n\n### LSTGAN\n| Parameter | Default | Description |\n|-----------|---------|-------------|\n| `hidden_dim` | 64 | Hidden dimension size |\n| `num_layers` | 3 | Number of ST blocks |\n| `dropout` | 0.1 | Dropout rate |\n| `num_heads` | 8 | Attention heads |\n\n### MLCAFormer\n| Parameter | Default | Description |\n|-----------|---------|-------------|\n| `d_model` | 64 | Model dimension |\n| `num_layers` | 3 | Number of MLCA blocks |\n| `num_heads` | 8 | Attention heads |\n| `d_ff` | 256 | Feed-forward dimension |\n| `dropout` | 0.1 | Dropout rate |\n\n---\n\n## Architecture Overview\n\n### LSTGAN Flow\n```\nInput → Input Projection → ST Blocks → Temporal Projection → Output Projection\n         (feature_dim → hidden_dim)     (×num_layers)      (seq mapping)    (→ output_dim)\n\nST Block: Graph Attention → Temporal Conv → Residual → LayerNorm\n```\n\n### MLCAFormer Flow\n```\nInput → Input Embedding → Positional Encoding → MLCA Blocks → Temporal Decoder → Output\n        (feature_dim → d_model)  (temporal info)    (×num_layers)    (seq mapping)\n\nMLCA Block: Temporal Causal Attn → Spatial Attn → Feed-Forward\n```\n\n---\n\n## Expected Input/Output Shapes\n\n### Input\n```python\nbatch = {\n    \'X\': Tensor of shape (batch_size, input_window, num_nodes, feature_dim),\n    \'y\': Tensor of shape (batch_size, output_window, num_nodes, output_dim)\n}\n```\n\n### Output\n```python\npredictions: Tensor of shape (batch_size, output_window, nu