o "Timer-XL LibCity Integration Setup"\necho "========================================="\n\nPROJECT_ROOT="/home/wangwenrui/private/shk/codex"\nLIBCITY_ROOT="$PROJECT_ROOT/Bigscity-LibCity"\nOPENLTM_ROOT="$PROJECT_ROOT/OpenLTM-main"\n\n# Step 1: Create directories\necho "[1/7] Creating directories..."\nmkdir -p "$LIBCITY_ROOT/libcity/model/layers/timer_xl"\nmkdir -p "$LIBCITY_ROOT/libcity/model/utils"\nmkdir -p "$LIBCITY_ROOT/scripts"\n\n# Step 2: Copy layer files\necho "[2/7] Copying layer files..."\ncp "$OPENLTM_ROOT/layers/"*.py "$LIBCITY_ROOT/libcity/model/layers/timer_xl/"\n\n# Step 3: Copy utils\necho "[3/7] Copying utility files..."\ncp "$OPENLTM_ROOT/utils/masking.py" "$LIBCITY_ROOT/libcity/model/utils/"\n\n# Step 4: Create __init__.py files\necho "[4/7] Creating __init__.py files..."\ntouch "$LIBCITY_ROOT/libcity/model/layers/timer_xl/__init__.py"\ntouch "$LIBCITY_ROOT/libcity/model/utils/__init__.py"\n\n# Step 5: Install dependencies\necho "[5/7] Installing dependencies..."\ncd "$LIBCITY_ROOT"\npip install einops -q\n\n# Step 6: Verify files\necho "[6/7] Verifying installation..."\nif [ -f "$LIBCITY_ROOT/libcity/model/layers/timer_xl/SelfAttention_Family.py" ]; then\n    echo "✓ Layer files copied"\nelse\n    echo "✗ Layer files missing"\n    exit 1\nfi\n\n# Step 7: Done\necho "[7/7] Setup complete!"\necho ""\necho "Next steps:"\necho "1. Create TimerXL.py model file"\necho "2. Create TimerXL.json config file"\necho "3. Update __init__.py to register model"\necho "4. Run: python run_model.py --task traffic_state_pred --model TimerXL --dataset METR_LA --max_epoch 1"\necho ""\necho "========================================="\n```\n\n### Script 2: Batch Testing\n\n**File:** `scripts/test_all_timer_xl.sh`\n\n```bash\n#!/bin/bash\n# Test Timer-XL on all datasets\n\nDATASETS=("METR_LA" "PEMS_BAY" "PEMS04" "PEMS07" "PEMS08")\n\nfor dataset in "${DATASETS[@]}"; do\n    echo "Testing Timer-XL on $dataset..."\n    python run_model.py \\\n        --task traffic_state_