t and registry entry\n\n---\n\n## Key Features Implemented\n\n### Model Architecture\n- ✅ **Input Embedding**: Maps traffic features to hidden dimension\n- ✅ **Spatial Embeddings**: Learnable node position encodings\n- ✅ **Temporal Embeddings**: Time step position encodings\n- ✅ **Grid Encoder**: Maps observations to latent grid via attention\n- ✅ **Transformer Encoder**: Multi-head self-attention processing\n- ✅ **Grid Decoder**: Cross-attention from grid to targets\n- ✅ **Output Projection**: Final prediction layer\n\n### LibCity Integration\n- ✅ Inherits from `AbstractTrafficStateModel`\n- ✅ Compatible with standard batch format: `{'X': ..., 'y': ...}`\n- ✅ Integrated with LibCity's scaler system\n- ✅ Uses LibCity's loss functions (masked MAE)\n- ✅ Supports all LibCity datasets (METR_LA, PEMS04, etc.)\n\n---\n\n## Usage\n\n### Basic Training\n```bash\npython run_model.py --task traffic_state_pred --model GriddedTNP --dataset METR_LA\n```\n\n### Custom Configuration\n```bash\npython run_model.py --task traffic_state_pred --model GriddedTNP --dataset PEMS04 \\\n    --hidden_dim 256 --num_layers 4 --grid_size 64\n```\n\n### Python API\n```python\nfrom libcity.model.traffic_speed_prediction import GriddedTNP\n\nconfig = {'hidden_dim': 128, 'num_heads': 4, 'device': 'cpu'}\ndata_feature = {'num_nodes': 207, 'feature_dim': 2, 'output_dim': 1}\nmodel = GriddedTNP(config, data_feature)\n```\n\n---\n\n## Model Parameters\n\n### Architecture (Tunable)\n- `hidden_dim`: 128 (default) - Hidden dimension\n- `num_heads`: 4 - Number of attention heads\n- `num_layers`: 3 - Number of transformer layers\n- `dropout`: 0.1 - Dropout rate\n- `grid_size`: 32 - Latent grid size\n\n### Training\n- `learning_rate`: 0.001 - Adam optimizer\n- `lr_scheduler`: cosinelr - Cosine annealing\n- `max_epoch`: 100\n- `patience`: 20 - Early stopping\n- `batch_size`: 64 (configurable)\n\n---\n\n## Adaptations from Original Paper\n\n### Simplifications\n1. **Single-Modal Input**: Simplified from multi-