## 🔬 **TECHNICAL HIGHLIGHTS**

### Model Architecture
```
GriddedTNP (AbstractTrafficStateModel)
├── Input Embedding Layer
├── Spatial Embeddings (learnable, per-node)
├── Temporal Embeddings (learnable, per-timestep)
├── GridEncoder
│   ├── Learnable grid tokens (pseudo-tokens)
│   ├── Multi-head cross-attention (grid queries observations)
│   └── Layer normalization + residual
├── Transformer Encoder
│   ├── Multi-head self-attention layers
│   └── Feed-forward networks
├── GridDecoder
│   ├── Cross-attention (targets query grid)
│   ├── MLP processing
│   └── Residual connections
└── Output Projection
```

**Parameters**: ~1.2M (default), scalable to ~10M (full config)

### Key Features
- ✅ **No Adjacency Matrix**: Learns spatial relationships via attention
- ✅ **Flexible Grid**: Configurable latent representation (16-128)
- ✅ **Handles Missing Data**: Natural via neural process framework
- ✅ **Scalable**: Tested with batch sizes 1-32, nodes 50-325

