hancements\n1. **Knowledge Distillation Support**:\n   - Port teacher model (STGCN)\n   - Implement `RSTIBDistillationExecutor`\n   - Add distillation loss terms\n\n2. **Advanced Features**:\n   - Dynamic Node Embeddings (DNE) testing\n   - Multi-dataset evaluation\n   - Ablation studies on Information Bottleneck\n\n3. **Documentation**:\n   - Add RSTIB to LibCity model zoo\n   - Create tutorial notebook\n   - Benchmark against baseline models\n\n---\n\n## Reference Documentation\n\n### Original Repository Structure\n```\nRSTIB/\n├── componenets/\n│   ├── metrics.py\n│   ├── new_metrics.py\n│   └── normalization.py\n├── config/\n│   └── [YAML configuration files]\n├── data/\n│   └── DataHandler_st.py\n├── methods/\n│   ├── student/\n│   │   ├── RSTIB_MLP.py    # Main model\n│   │   ├── mlp.py          # MLP component\n│   │   └── __init__.py\n│   └── teacher/\n│       ├── mlp/\n│       └── stgcn/\n├── utils/\n│   ├── adjacent_matrix_norm.py\n│   └── util.py\n├── engine.py               # Training engine\n├── train_student.py       # Student training\n├── train_teacher.py       # Teacher training\n├── requirements.txt\n└── README.md\n```\n\n### LibCity Integration Points\n```\nBigscity-LibCity/\n├── libcity/\n│   ├── model/\n│   │   └── traffic_speed_prediction/\n│   │       ├── RSTIB.py                    # ✅ Ported model\n│   │       └── __init__.py                 # ✅ Updated\n│   ├── config/\n│   │   ├── task_config.json                # ✅ Updated\n│   │   └── model/traffic_state_pred/\n│   │       └── RSTIB.json                  # ✅ Configuration\n│   ├── data/\n│   │   └── dataset/\n│   │       └── traffic_state_point_dataset.py  # Used by RSTIB\n│   ├── executor/\n│   │   └── traffic_state_executor.py       # Used by RSTIB\n│   └── evaluator/\n│       └── traffic_state_evaluator.py      # Used by RSTIB\n└── raw_data/                               # Datasets\n    ├── METR_LA/\n    ├── PEMSD4/\n    ├── PEMSD7/\n    └── PEMSD8/\n```\n\n---\n\n## Dependencies Comp