ation (n_sample > 1)\n- ⏳ Custom loss weighting (info_beta tuning)\n\nThese can be added as future enhancements if needed.\n\n---\n\n## Troubleshooting\n\n### Issue: Model not found\n**Solution**: Ensure task_config.json has been updated with RSTIB entry\n\n### Issue: Dataset not loading\n**Solution**: Check that dataset exists in `raw_data/` directory\n\n### Issue: CUDA out of memory\n**Solution**: Reduce batch_size or use smaller model dimensions\n\n### Issue: Poor performance\n**Solution**:\n1. Check data normalization (should use \'standard\' scaler)\n2. Verify temporal features are enabled (add_time_in_day=true)\n3. Tune learning rate and epochs\n\n---\n\n## References\n\n### Paper\n- **Title**: Information Bottleneck-guided MLPs for Robust Spatial-temporal Forecasting\n- **Conference**: ICML 2025\n- **Authors**: Min Chen, Guansong Pang, Wenjun Wang, Cheng Yan\n\n### Code\n- **Original**: https://github.com/mchen644/RSTIB\n- **LibCity**: https://github.com/LibCity/Bigscity-LibCity\n\n### Documentation\n- **LibCity Docs**: Available in repository\n- **RSTIB Checklist**: `RSTIB_MIGRATION_CHECKLIST.md`\n- **Testing Script**: `rstib_test.py`\n\n---\n\n## Contact & Support\n\nFor issues with the RSTIB integration:\n1. Review `RSTIB_MIGRATION_CHECKLIST.md` for detailed documentation\n2. Run `python rstib_test.py --test all` to diagnose issues\n3. Check LibCity GitHub issues for similar problems\n4. Refer to original RSTIB repository for model-specific questions\n\n---\n\n## Conclusion\n\n✅ **RSTIB is fully integrated into LibCity and ready for production use.**\n\nThe model has been:\n- ✅ Successfully ported with all key components\n- ✅ Registered in LibCity\'s model registry\n- ✅ Validated through automated tests\n- ✅ Documented comprehensively\n- ✅ Equipped with testing utilities\n\nUsers can now train RSTIB on any supported dataset using LibCity\'s standard CLI interface.\n\n---\n\n**Generated**: 2025-01-26\n**Status**: Migration Complete\n**Next Review**: After f