y\n-rwxr-xr-x README.md       # ✓ Original documentation\n-rwxr-xr-x requirements.txt # ✓ Dependencies\ndrwxr-xr-x tnp/            # ✓ Source code\ndrwxr-xr-x experiments/    # ✓ Original experiments\n```\n\n#### 1.2 Model Architecture Analysis\n\nThe GriddedTNP model uses a transformer-based neural process architecture with grid encoding:\n\n**Core Components**:\n\n1. **Input Embedding Layer**\n   - Maps raw features to hidden dimension\n   - `nn.Linear(feature_dim, hidden_dim)`\n\n2. **Spatial Embeddings**\n   - Learnable position encodings for each sensor/node\n   - `nn.Parameter(torch.randn(num_nodes, hidden_dim))`\n\n3. **Temporal Embeddings**\n   - Learnable time step encodings\n   - `nn.Parameter(torch.randn(seq_len, hidden_dim))`\n\n4. **Grid Encoder** (Novel Component)\n   - Maps point observations to latent grid representation\n   - Uses learnable grid tokens (pseudo-tokens)\n   - Cross-attention mechanism: grid queries observations\n   - Grid size: Configurable (default 32)\n\n5. **Transformer Encoder**\n   - Processes gridded representations\n   - Multi-head self-attention\n   - 3 layers × 4 heads (default)\n\n6. **Grid Decoder**\n   - Maps from grid back to target locations\n   - Cross-attention: targets query grid\n   - MLP for final processing\n\n7. **Output Projection**\n   - Linear layer to output dimension\n   - `nn.Linear(hidden_dim, output_dim)`\n\n**Model Flow**:\n```\nInput (B, T_in, N, F)\n  ↓ Embed\nEmbedded Features (B, T_in×N, H)\n  ↓ Add Spatial + Temporal Embeddings\nContextualized Features (B, T_in×N, H)\n  ↓ Grid Encoder\nGrid Representation (B, grid_size, H)\n  ↓ Transformer\nProcessed Grid (B, grid_size, H)\n  ↓ Grid Decoder\nTarget Features (B, T_out×N, H)\n  ↓ Project\nOutput Predictions (B, T_out, N, O)\n```\n\n#### 1.3 LibCity Integration\n\n**Files Created**:\n\n1. **Model Implementation**: `Bigscity-LibCity/libcity/model/traffic_speed_prediction/GriddedTNP.py`\n   - Lines: 303\n   - Classes: GriddedTNP, GridEncoder, GridDecoder\n   - Inherits: AbstractTrafficStateModel\n   - Methods: `__init__`, `forward`, `predict`, `calculate_loss`\n\n2. **Configuration File**: `Bigscity-LibCity/libcity/config/model/traffic_state_pred/GriddedTNP.json`\n   - Parameters: 26\n   - Categories: Architecture, Training, Data Processing\n\n3. **Data Adapters**: `scripts/gridded_tnp_adapter.py`\n   - Lines: 322\n   - Components:\n     - `GriddedTNPDatasetAdapter`: Batch conversion\n     - `WeatherDataAdapter`: NetCDF to LibCity format\n     - Helper functions for config generation\n\n**Files Modified**:\n\n1. **Model Registry**: `Bigscity-LibCity/libcity/model/traffic_speed_prediction/__init__.py`\n   - Added import: `from libcity.model.traffic_speed_prediction.GriddedTNP import GriddedTNP`\n   - Added to `__all__`: `"GriddedTNP"`\n\n#### 1.4 Data Ingestion Alignment\n\n**Input Signature Verification**:\n\n✅ **Compatible with LibCity\'s TrafficStateDataset**\n\n```python\n# Expected Input Format\nbatch = {\n    \'X\': torch.Tensor,  # Shape: (batch_size, input_window, num_nodes, feature_dim)\n    \'y\': torch.Tensor   # Shape: (batch_size, output_window, num_nodes, output_dim)\n}\n\n# GriddedTNP Implementation\ndef forward(self, batch):\n    x = batch[\'X\'].to(self.device)  # ✓ Matches\n    # ... processing ...\n    return predictions  # Shape: (B, output_window, num_nodes, output_dim) ✓\n```\n\n**Dataset Schema**:\n\n| Parameter | LibCity Standard | GriddedTNP | Status |\n|-----------|-----------------|------------|--------|\n| Input shape | (B, T_in, N, F) | (B, T_in, N, F) | ✅ Match |\n| Output shape | (B, T_out, N, O) | (B, T_out, N, O) | ✅ Match |\n| Batch dict keys | \'X\', \'y\' | \'X\', \'y\' | ✅ Match |\n| Scaler support | Yes (optional) | Yes (integrated) | ✅ Match |\n| Adjacency matrix | Optional | Not required | ✅ Compatible |\n\n**Scaler Integration**:\n\n```python\n# In __init__\nself._scaler = self.data_feature.get(\'scaler\')\n\n# In calculate_loss\nif self._scaler is not None:\n    y_true = self._scaler.inverse_transform(y_true)\n    y_pred = self._scaler.inverse_transform(y_pred)\n```\n\nSupported scalers: `standard`, `minmax`, `log`, `none`\n\n#### 1.5 Configuration Parameters\n\n**Complete Parameter List**:\n\n```json\n{\n  "// Architecture Parameters": "",\n  "hidden_dim": 128,\n  "num_heads": 4,\n  "num_layers": 3,\n  "dropout": 0.1,\n  "grid_size": 32,\n\n  "// Data Processing": "",\n  "scaler": "standard",\n  "load_external": true,\n  "add_time_in_day": true,\n  "add_day_in_week": true,\n  "input_window": 12,\n  "output_window": 12,\n\n  "// Training Parameters": "",\n  "max_epoch": 100,\n  "batch_size": 64,\n  "learning_rate": 0.001,\n  "learner": "adam",\n  "lr_scheduler": "cosinelr",\n  "lr_decay_ratio": 0.1,\n  "clip_grad_norm": true,\n  "max_grad_norm": 5,\n\n  "// Early Stopping": "",\n  "use_early_stop": true,\n  "patience": 20,\n\n  "// Logging": "",\n  "log_every": 1,\n  "saved_model": true,\n  "save_mode": "best"\n}\n```\n\n**Tuning Recommendations**:\n\n| Parameter | Small Dataset | Medium Dataset | Large Dataset |\n|-----------|---------------|----------------|---------------|\n| `hidden_dim` | 64 | 128 | 256 |\n| `num_layers` | 2 | 3 | 4 |\n| `grid_size` | 16 | 32 | 64 |\n| `batch_size` | 32 | 64 | 128 |\n| `learning_rate` | 0.001 | 0.001 | 0.0005 |\n\n#### 1.6 Automation Helpers\n\n**Location**: `scripts/gridded_tnp_adapter.py`\n\n**Components**:\n\n1. **GriddedTNPDatasetAdapter**\n   ```python\n   adapter = GriddedTNPDatasetAdapter()\n   adapted_batch = adapter.adapt_batch(libcity_batch)\n   spatial_features = adapter.create_spatial_features(coordinates)\n   ```\n\n2. **WeatherDataAdapter**\n   ```python\n   adapter = WeatherDataAdapter()\n   libcity_data = adapter.convert_netcdf_to_libcity(\n       netcdf_path="era5_data.nc",\n       variable="temperature"\n   )\n   ```\n\n3. **Config Generator**\n   ```python\n   from scripts.gridded_tnp_adapter import create_training_config\n\n   config = create_training_config(\n       dataset_name="METR_LA",\n       hidden_dim=256,\n       num_layers=4\n   )\n   ```\n\n---\n\n## Stage 2: Automated Verification\n\n### ✅ Test Suite Results\n\n**Overall Status**: 8/8 Tests PASSED (100%)\n\n#### Test 1: File Existence Check\n**Status**: ✅ PASSED\n\n```\n✓ Model File: GriddedTNP.py (303 lines)\n✓ Config File: GriddedTNP.json (26 parameters)\n✓ Init File: __init__.py (registration confirmed)\n✓ Adapter File: gridded_tnp_adapter.py (322 lines)\n✓ Original Repo: gridded-tnp/ (git history intact)\n```\n\n#### Test 2: Model Import\n**Status**: ✅ PASSED\n\n```python\nfrom libcity.model.traffic_speed_prediction.GriddedTNP import (\n    GriddedTNP,      # ✓ Imported successfully\n    GridEncoder,     # ✓ Imported successfully\n    GridDecoder      # ✓ Imported successfully\n)\n```\n\n#### Test 3: Model Instantiation\n**Status**: ✅ PASSED\n\nTested with 3 configurations:\n\n| Configuration | Parameters | Result |\n|---------------|------------|--------|\n| Small (64D, 2L, 16G) | 166,145 | ✅ Success |\n| Medium (128D, 3L, 32G) | 827,521 | ✅ Success |\n| Large (256D, 4L, 64G) | 4,025,857 | ✅ Success |\n\n**Note**: Default (Medium) config selected for further testing.\n\n#### Test 4: Forward Pass\n**Status**: ✅ PASSED\n\n```\nInput:  (8, 12, 207, 2)  # batch, time_in, nodes, features\nOutput: (8, 12, 207, 1)  # batch, time_out, nodes, predictions\n✓ Output shape correct\n✓ Forward pass time: 0.37s\n✓ Output statistics: mean=-0.167, std=0.646\n✓ No NaN or Inf values\n```\n\n#### Test 5: Loss Calculation\n**Status**: ✅ PASSED\n\n```\nLoss: 0.9513 (masked MAE)\n✓ Loss is finite\n✓ Loss is non-negative\n✓ Gradients computed successfully\n```\n\n#### Test 6: Training Simulation\n**Status**: ✅ PASSED\n\n```\nBatches: 10\nInitial loss: 0.9645\nFinal loss: 0.8284\n✓ Loss decreased (14.1% reduction)\n✓ Gradients flowing correctly\n✓ Optimizer step successful\n✓ No memory leaks detected\n```\n\n#### Test 7: Inference and Metrics\n**Status**: ✅ PASSED\n\n**Test Data**: 40 samples (5 b