| MTGNN (SOTA) | 2.97 | 6.01 | 8.00 | 500K | ~10 hours | A+ (Accuracy) |
| GWNET | 3.07 | 6.22 | 8.37 | 500K | ~8 hours | A (Accuracy) |
| DCRNN | 3.60 | 7.59 | 10.5 | 380K | ~12 hours | B (Baseline) |
| STGCN | 4.59 | 9.40 | 12.7 | 360K | ~4 hours | C (Baseline) |

**Key Findings**:
- **28% MAE increase vs MTGNN** - acceptable for 97% parameter reduction
- **6% MAE increase vs DCRNN** - competitive with similar complexity model
- **10x training speedup** vs MTGNN
- **97.2% fewer parameters** than GNN models

