d utilities\n│       └── metric.py                   # Evaluation metrics\n├── model_settings/                     # YAML configuration files\n│   ├── PEMS03.yaml\n│   ├── PEMS04.yaml\n│   ├── PEMS07.yaml\n│   ├── PEMS08.yaml\n│   ├── METR-LA.yaml\n│   └── PEMS-BAY.yaml\n├── train.py                            # Training script\n└── search.py                           # Architecture search script\n```\n\n### Model Characteristics\n- **Input Shape**: `[batch_size, num_features, num_nodes, input_window]`\n  - num_features: 1-3 (traffic speed + optional time embeddings)\n  - num_nodes: 207-358 depending on dataset\n  - input_window: 12 timesteps (default)\n\n- **Output Shape**: `[batch_size, 1, num_nodes, output_window]`\n  - output_window: 12 timesteps (default)\n\n- **Key Components**:\n  1. MLP-based input embedding (node + temporal embeddings)\n  2. Temporal search layer (DCC, Informer operations)\n  3. Multi-scale processing (scale_list)\n  4. Spatial search layer (GNN variants)\n  5. Linear fusion and output projection\n\n---\n\n## II. Migration Tasks - Detailed File Edits\n\n### Task 1: Copy Supporting Module Files\n**Location**: `./Bigscity-LibCity/libcity/model/traffic_speed_prediction/`\n\n#### File 1.1: Copy LinearLayer module\n- **Source**: `./repos/AutoSTF/src/model/LinearLayer.py`\n- **Target**: `./Bigscity-LibCity/libcity/model/traffic_speed_prediction/autostf_layers/linear_layer.py`\n- **Required Edits**:\n  - Change relative imports to absolute imports\n  - No other changes needed (self-contained module)\n\n**Actions**:\n```bash\nmkdir -p ./Bigscity-LibCity/libcity/model/traffic_speed_prediction/autostf_layers\ncp ./repos/AutoSTF/src/model/LinearLayer.py ./Bigscity-LibCity/libcity/model/traffic_speed_prediction/autostf_layers/linear_layer.py\n```\n\n#### File 1.2: Copy mode enumeration\n- **Source**: `./repos/AutoSTF/src/model/mode.py`\n- **Target**: `./Bigscity-LibCity/libcity/model/traffic_speed_prediction/autostf_layers/mode.py`\n- **Required Edits*