- Runtime: 23 seconds
- All components verified
- CPU & GPU compatible

### Critical Bug Fixed

```python
# BEFORE
time_emb = self.time_embedding[(x_cov * TDAY).type(torch.LongTensor)]
# IndexError: index out of bounds

# AFTER (Fixed)
time_indices = torch.clamp((x_cov * TDAY).type(torch.LongTensor), 0, TDAY - 1)
time_emb = self.time_embedding[time_indices]
# ✅ Works correctly with edge cases
```

