(default) - Number of prototypes\n- `prototype_dim`: 64 (default) - Prototype dimension\n\n### Loss Weights (Critical)\n- `lamb_c`: 0.1 (default) - Contrastive loss weight\n- `lamb_d`: 1.0 (default) - Deviation loss weight\n- `margin`: 0.5 (default) - Triplet margin\n\n### Training\n- `max_epoch`: 200 (default)\n- `learning_rate`: 0.01 (default)\n- `lr_scheduler`: "multisteplr" (default)\n- `steps`: [50, 100] (default)\n\n---\n\n## 🎯 Supported Datasets\n\n### Paper Datasets (Original)\n- METR-LA (207 sensors)\n- PEMS-BAY (325 sensors)\n- PEMS03, PEMS04, PEMS07, PEMS08\n- PEMS-D7M (228 sensors)\n\n### LibCity Compatible\nAll `TrafficStatePointDataset` datasets:\n- METR_LA, PEMS_BAY\n- PEMSD3, PEMSD4, PEMSD7, PEMSD8, PEMSD7(M)\n- LOOP_SEATTLE, LOS_LOOP\n- And 20+ more datasets\n\n---\n\n## ⚠️ Known Issues & Solutions\n\n### Issue 1: Import Error\n**Error**: `ModuleNotFoundError: No module named \'libcity.model.traffic_speed_prediction.STSSDL\'`\n\n**Solution**:\n- Verify `__init__.py` is updated\n- Run: `grep STSSDL Bigscity-LibCity/libcity/model/traffic_speed_prediction/__init__.py`\n\n### Issue 2: Model Not Found\n**Error**: `Model STSSDL not found in task_config.json`\n\n**Solution**:\n- Verify task_config.json is updated\n- Run: `grep STSSDL Bigscity-LibCity/libcity/config/task_config.json`\n\n### Issue 3: Time Embedding Out of Bounds\n**Error**: `IndexError: index out of range`\n\n**Solution**:\n- Adjust `TDAY` parameter in config\n- Default: 288 (for 5-minute intervals)\n\n### Issue 4: Loss Becomes NaN\n**Causes**:\n- Learning rate too high\n- Loss weights imbalanced\n\n**Solutions**:\n- Reduce learning rate: `learning_rate: 0.001`\n- Tune loss weights: `lamb_c: 0.05`, `lamb_d: 0.5`\n- Enable gradient clipping: `max_grad_norm: 5`\n\n---\n\n## 📖 Documentation Files\n\n### Main Documentation\n**File**: `./documentation/ST-SSDL_Migration_Complete.md`\n**Sections**:\n- Executive Summary\n- Repository Structure\n- LibCity Integration Files\n- Model Architecture Detai