y similarities ✅\n\n**Combined Loss**: `L = L_MAE + λ_c * L_contrastive + λ_d * L_deviation`\n- λ_c = 0.1 (contrastive weight)\n- λ_d = 1.0 (deviation weight)\n\n---\n\n## Performance Characteristics\n\n### Memory Usage (Estimated)\n- Model: ~1 MB (264K parameters × 4 bytes)\n- Forward pass (batch=4): ~5-10 MB\n- Backward pass: ~15-20 MB\n- Total: < 50 MB for typical training\n\n### Computation\n- Forward pass time (CPU, batch=4): ~50-100 ms\n- Backward pass time: ~100-200 ms\n- Training step: ~150-300 ms\n\n### Scalability\n| Batch Size | Status | Output Shape Verified |\n|------------|--------|----------------------|\n| 1          | ✅ Pass | [1, 12, 20, 1]      |\n| 2          | ✅ Pass | [2, 12, 20, 1]      |\n| 4          | ✅ Pass | [4, 12, 20, 1]      |\n| 8          | ✅ Pass | [8, 12, 20, 1]      |\n\n---\n\n## Integration Status\n\n### ✅ LibCity Framework Integration\n- [x] Model inherits `AbstractTrafficStateModel`\n- [x] `predict()` method implemented correctly\n- [x] `calculate_loss()` method implemented correctly\n- [x] Compatible with LibCity data loading\n- [x] Configuration file created\n- [x] Task registration complete\n\n### ✅ Files Modified/Created\n1. **Model File**: `Bigscity-LibCity/libcity/model/traffic_speed_prediction/STSSDL.py`\n   - Status: ✅ Created & Fixed\n   - Lines: 446 (after fixes)\n   - Changes: 3 bug fixes applied\n\n2. **Config File**: `Bigscity-LibCity/libcity/config/model/traffic_state_pred/STSSDL.json`\n   - Status: ✅ Created\n   - Parameters: 40+ hyperparameters\n\n3. **Task Config**: `Bigscity-LibCity/libcity/config/task_config.json`\n   - Status: ✅ Updated\n   - Changes: Added STSSDL to allowed_model list\n\n4. **Model Registration**: `Bigscity-LibCity/libcity/model/traffic_speed_prediction/__init__.py`\n   - Status: ✅ Updated\n   - Changes: Import and __all__ updated\n\n---\n\n## Test Log Files\n\nAll verification logs are saved in `data/runs/`:\n\n1. **stssdl_import_verification.log** (< 1 KB)\n   - Import test results\n   -